# The world code: the files whose contents decide what the generated world looks like. WorldGate hashes them, in this
# order, into tools/worldgate.stamp when the world they build passes the gate, and the Claude Code hooks refuse to
# commit changes to them (or end a session with them changed) until the stamp matches again. Paths are relative to
# "2006Scape Server". Add any new file that places terrain or objects.
